{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07467","headline":"罪所上御史惟则 · 刘长卿","name":"罪所上御史惟则","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"误因微禄滞南昌，幽系圜扉昼夜长。\n黄鹤翅垂同燕雀，青松心在任风霜。\n斗间谁与看冤气，盆下无由见太阳。\n贤达不能同感激，更於何处问苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07467.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07467","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}